  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the management of 767,766 hectares of wetland protected areas in Sichuan Province. This will be achieved through various strategies, including knowledge transfer, information exchange, capacity building, community engagement, and environmental education. The establishment of the Sichuan network of wetland protected areas, consisting of 39 wetland parks and 40 wetland nature reserves, will support improved management. The project will focus on two specific areas within</narrative>
